{{!
    @template tool_vae/refs_page

    The page of the addresses of the rules of validation, below its heading: what is kept, whether the addresses are shown
    to the vaeistes, the error of the last sending, then a notification when no record is imported, or the table of the
    records, the heading and the form to add an address.

    Every text comes from the context, already worded by tool_vae\output\refs_page. The template holds no logic. The text
    is escaped (double braces). Six keys are HTML made by the core or by another template, placed as they are (triple
    braces): closedhtml, errorhtml and nonehtml, notifications of the core ($output->notification()); tablehtml, the table
    drawn by the template tool_vae/table; headinghtml, a heading of the core ($output->heading()); formhtml, the form of the
    core (moodleform::render()), drawn once.

    Classes required for JS:
    * none

    Data attributes required for JS:
    * none

    Context variables required for this template:
    * intro - string, what is kept and what is not
    * closedhtml - false, or HTML: the notification that the addresses are not shown to the vaeistes
    * errorhtml - false, or HTML: the error of the last sending
    * nonehtml - false, or HTML: the notification drawn when no record is imported
    * tablehtml - false, or HTML: the table of the records and their addresses
    * headinghtml - false, or HTML: the heading above the form
    * formhtml - false, or HTML: the form to add an address

    Example context (json):
    {
        "intro": "For each imported record, give the pages where the certifier publishes its rule of validation.",
        "closedhtml": "<div class=\"alert alert-info\" role=\"alert\">The addresses are not shown to candidates.</div>",
        "errorhtml": false,
        "nonehtml": false,
        "tablehtml": "<table class=\"generaltable\"><tbody><tr><td>DEMOBLOCS — Demo blocs</td></tr></tbody></table>",
        "headinghtml": "<h3>Add an address</h3>",
        "formhtml": "<form method=\"post\" action=\"https://example.com/admin/tool/vae/refs.php\"></form>"
    }
}}
<p>{{intro}}</p>
{{#closedhtml}}
{{{closedhtml}}}
{{/closedhtml}}
{{#errorhtml}}
{{{errorhtml}}}
{{/errorhtml}}
{{#nonehtml}}
{{{nonehtml}}}
{{/nonehtml}}
{{#tablehtml}}
{{{tablehtml}}}
{{/tablehtml}}
{{#headinghtml}}
{{{headinghtml}}}
{{/headinghtml}}
{{#formhtml}}
{{{formhtml}}}
{{/formhtml}}
